---
import Shell from '../layouts/Shell.astro';
import {topics} from '../data/content.json';
---
<Shell title="Quran Concept Atlas"><section class="intro"><span class="eyebrow">One passage opens another</span><h1>Follow a thread<br/>through the Quran.</h1><p>Explore 30 themes, 90 selected passages, and connections you can follow at your own pace.</p></section><div class="notice bottom-gap"><p>These themes and learning paths are editorial guides. They do not replace reading a passage in its full context.</p></div><section class="panel bottom-gap"><div class="panel-body"><div class="filters"><label class="field">Find a theme<input type="search" id="filter" placeholder="Patience, prayer, justice…"/></label><label class="field">Area<select id="category"><option value="">All areas</option>{['Character','Community','Reflection','Worship'].map(g=><option>{g}</option>)}</select></label><label><input type="checkbox" id="saved-only"/> Saved only</label><button class="button secondary" id="export">Copy saved reading list</button></div><p class="micro" id="count" aria-live="polite"></p></div></section><div class="card-grid">{topics.map(t=><article class="panel activity-card" data-item-id={t.id} data-category={t.category}><span class="eyebrow">{t.category}</span><h2><a href={`/topic/${t.id}/`} data-reading-link={t.id}>{t.theme}</a></h2><p>{t.explanation}</p><span class="micro">{t.refs.join(' · ')}</span><div class="actions"><a class="button" href={`/topic/${t.id}/`}>Explore theme ↗</a><button class="button secondary" data-save={t.id} aria-pressed="false">Save reading</button></div></article>)}</div><div id="empty" class="empty" hidden><h2>No themes match</h2><p>Try another word, change the area, or turn off Saved only.</p></div><script>import '../lib/library';</script></Shell>
